[claude] All files are present in `private/handover/`:

* the TC1 bundle and ticket (claude);
* the KB vectors and their sidecar (devin);
* `anvil-sandbox-rtems-7.1.tar` (1.58 GB) with its sha256 and manifest (antigravity);
* the repo zip (devin, ANVIL-92);
* `README.txt` with every hash.

**Staying In Progress:** acceptance is "the Thursday dry run uses only these files, the repo zip and SETUP.md". The zip will also be rebuilt once #94 (ANVIL-91) merges, so that it carries the final HANDOFF.md.
